WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.012 --> 00:00:00.906
- Hi, I'm Johnny.

00:00:00.906 --> 00:00:01.739
- I'm Stacey.

00:00:01.739 --> 00:00:02.712
- My name is Eric.

00:00:02.712 --> 00:00:05.001
- And today, I'm going to turn my mom emo.

00:00:05.001 --> 00:00:05.834
- Yay.

00:00:05.834 --> 00:00:06.737
- This is going to be bad.

00:00:06.737 --> 00:00:09.917
(exciting music)

00:00:09.917 --> 00:00:12.247
- It means emotional so there
is definitely a lot of that.

00:00:12.247 --> 00:00:14.330
- I'll also put some red
and pink around the eyes

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:16.412
to make it look like I've
been crying all night.

00:00:16.412 --> 00:00:17.719
- People thought you were weird.

00:00:17.719 --> 00:00:19.277
They were just like, what's your problem?

00:00:19.277 --> 00:00:21.801
- Mom, why do you think
I do my makeup like this?

00:00:21.801 --> 00:00:24.476
- It's hard to put in words
but it's just who you are.

00:00:24.476 --> 00:00:25.522
- I don't think she had any questions

00:00:25.522 --> 00:00:27.199
about why I did my makeup the way I did.

00:00:27.199 --> 00:00:29.485
All of it started around the time that

00:00:29.485 --> 00:00:31.060
I knew they were going to get a divorce.

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:32.630
- She really has told me a few times

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:33.847
that she wants to look like me

00:00:33.847 --> 00:00:36.597
so I'm going to make that happen.

00:00:37.573 --> 00:00:39.004
- Very old school.

00:00:39.004 --> 00:00:39.884
- You grew up okay.

00:00:39.884 --> 00:00:40.717
- Okay.

00:00:40.717 --> 00:00:41.550
- So far.

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.047
- I think it's going to look very bad.

00:00:44.047 --> 00:00:46.345
(light music)

00:00:46.345 --> 00:00:47.613
So the first thing we're going to be doing

00:00:47.613 --> 00:00:48.676
is we're going to change this.

00:00:48.676 --> 00:00:49.851
- My son is dressing me.

00:00:49.851 --> 00:00:51.252
This is sooner than I thought.

00:00:51.252 --> 00:00:54.037
- We have some eyeliner here
for you dad or guyliner.

00:00:54.037 --> 00:00:55.787
- I need you to like,

00:00:56.731 --> 00:00:59.335
I'm not really sure what I
need you to do to be honest.

00:00:59.335 --> 00:01:00.567
- May I?

00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:01.612
- Sure.

00:01:01.612 --> 00:01:02.445
- Great.

00:01:02.445 --> 00:01:03.503
- Do you like emo music?

00:01:03.503 --> 00:01:04.633
- What kind?

00:01:04.633 --> 00:01:06.506
- Have you heard of Hawthorne Heights?

00:01:06.506 --> 00:01:07.339
- No.

00:01:07.339 --> 00:01:08.647
- Taking Back Sunday?

00:01:08.647 --> 00:01:09.480
- No.

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:10.690
- Mom, you're moving.

00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:11.523
- Of course, I'm moving,

00:01:11.523 --> 00:01:13.391
you're sticking something in my eye.

00:01:13.391 --> 00:01:14.453
- Fantastic.

00:01:14.453 --> 00:01:15.286
Oh shoot.

00:01:15.286 --> 00:01:16.375
- Oh my gollies.

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:17.805
- One eye is enough.

00:01:17.805 --> 00:01:19.396
- Senses Fail?

00:01:19.396 --> 00:01:20.229
- No.

00:01:20.229 --> 00:01:21.357
- I'm sorry.

00:01:21.357 --> 00:01:22.704
Oh no.

00:01:22.704 --> 00:01:24.830
This is not looking how
I wanted it to look.

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:26.508
- The All American Rejects?

00:01:26.508 --> 00:01:27.341
- No.

00:01:28.226 --> 00:01:29.449
Johnny Mathis.

00:01:29.449 --> 00:01:30.714
- Alright, so now we have the eyeshadow

00:01:30.714 --> 00:01:33.493
so what we're going to use
is none of these colors.

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:35.669
We're just going to use that solid black.

00:01:35.669 --> 00:01:36.502
No, oh no.

00:01:38.324 --> 00:01:40.760
Why am I doing so bad?

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:41.986
- Plus, you're having
extra black everywhere

00:01:41.986 --> 00:01:45.133
which is a benefit or a bonus, you know?

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:45.966
- Okay.

00:01:45.966 --> 00:01:46.799
- I may not...

00:01:46.799 --> 00:01:49.139
(laughing)

00:01:49.139 --> 00:01:51.091
- A lot of emo kids
have hair in their eyes.

00:01:51.091 --> 00:01:53.664
I don't think we can
accomplish that today.

00:01:53.664 --> 00:01:54.566
- Here it comes.

00:01:54.566 --> 00:01:56.470
- Some fake hair.

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:57.303
- We're going to try
and make you look like

00:01:57.303 --> 00:01:58.886
an anime character.

00:02:00.139 --> 00:02:01.407
- Is this black?

00:02:01.407 --> 00:02:02.406
- No.

00:02:02.406 --> 00:02:03.789
- I don't own black lipstick.

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:04.947
- What?

00:02:04.947 --> 00:02:08.864
- A lot of emo kids and
scene kids put on a bandana

00:02:08.864 --> 00:02:12.864
and all the attention is
drawn to your sad eyes.

00:02:13.883 --> 00:02:16.031
- Do I need a weapon or anything?

00:02:16.031 --> 00:02:16.864
No?

00:02:16.864 --> 00:02:20.031
- I think I look just horrifying.

00:02:20.031 --> 00:02:21.135
- I think I agree.

00:02:21.135 --> 00:02:22.237
- Oh, great.

00:02:22.237 --> 00:02:24.987
(exciting music)

00:02:27.421 --> 00:02:28.254
- Tada.

00:02:29.665 --> 00:02:30.977
- Oh, wow.

00:02:30.977 --> 00:02:32.568
- Not bad actually.

00:02:32.568 --> 00:02:33.593
- That's pretty good.

00:02:33.593 --> 00:02:34.426
- Thank you.

00:02:34.426 --> 00:02:36.113
I got the validation of my father.

00:02:36.113 --> 00:02:39.968
- My eyes, they just look
like I've been crying.

00:02:39.968 --> 00:02:40.907
- That's very emo.

00:02:40.907 --> 00:02:41.823
- It's good.

00:02:41.823 --> 00:02:44.740
It's something to do together here.

00:02:45.715 --> 00:02:46.757
- I love it.

00:02:46.757 --> 00:02:48.968
- I think it'd be cool if
she took off the makeup.

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:49.801
- It was a good experience.

00:02:49.801 --> 00:02:53.859
I was happy to hear
Stacey explain it today

00:02:53.859 --> 00:02:54.922
because of course, at the time,

00:02:54.922 --> 00:02:57.014
she didn't have the ability to express it

00:02:57.014 --> 00:02:59.873
so she expressed it in
makeup, with clothes and hair.

00:02:59.873 --> 00:03:01.874
- It was possibly the most healthy way

00:03:01.874 --> 00:03:02.707
I could have done things.

00:03:02.707 --> 00:03:05.548
Hurting yourself is not a
healthy way to express those,

00:03:05.548 --> 00:03:07.143
all that angst and that hurt.

00:03:07.143 --> 00:03:08.929
- Do you feel more emo now?

00:03:08.929 --> 00:03:10.530
- I feel empowered.

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:12.212
- You don't feel depressed?

00:03:12.212 --> 00:03:13.349
- No.

00:03:13.349 --> 00:03:16.209
- It doesn't get any easier to

00:03:16.209 --> 00:03:18.042
express your emotions.

00:03:18.965 --> 00:03:21.034
You can't take yourself too seriously.

00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:22.764
- Do you have a sudden
urge to go on Myspace?

00:03:22.764 --> 00:03:23.976
- I want to go to Hot Topic.

00:03:23.976 --> 00:03:25.597
- Go to the Warped Tour.

00:03:25.597 --> 00:03:26.637
- Yeah.

00:03:26.637 --> 00:03:27.944
- I think you should keep the makeup on

00:03:27.944 --> 00:03:28.777
for the rest of the day.

00:03:28.777 --> 00:03:31.657
I think my mom is going
to be thrilled to see--

00:03:31.657 --> 00:03:32.490
- No.

00:03:33.565 --> 00:03:36.281
- Oh yeah, I for sure am

00:03:36.281 --> 00:03:39.281
and I'm going to be Snapchatting and

00:03:41.061 --> 00:03:42.582
Instagram and--
- Why'd I do this?

00:03:42.582 --> 00:03:43.687
No.

00:03:43.687 --> 00:03:44.643
- Twittering.

00:03:44.643 --> 00:03:46.667
Oh yeah and that Myspace.

00:03:46.667 --> 00:03:47.908
I don't have a Myspace.

